alse; run in a child process | [x] |\n| 21 | `hdr_compare` | realistic **MP3 frame-header corpus**: every (version, layer, bitrate 0..14, sample-rate 0..2, padding, private, CRC) combination materialised as a real 4-byte header for `h2`, cross-multiplied with the same corpus for `h1` (sampled) → outputs must match C | [x] |\n\n## Feature-combination matrix\n\n| # | feature combination | `cargo check` | Phase B | Phase C |\n|---|--------------------|---------------|---------|---------|\n| 1 | `--no-default-features` (empty set; the only combination — no `[features]` in `Cargo.toml`) | [x] | [x] | [x] |\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":381,"cache_read_input_tokens":42193,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":381,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9f595d59-0c25-4dea-9ef2-252193c84ef7","uuid":"afaabdd6-ec8b-4eba-bb2e-ed281a18807d","timestamp":"2026-08-19T15:12:31.395Z"}
